{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuing My Uncle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a week at your uncle\u2019s house in this short, choice-driven visual novel.<br>From time to time, a special <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button will appear, letting you move the story forward in unexpected ways.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approx. 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for ages 12 and up (R12)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button cannot be skipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the scene, the button may appear as <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Pursue / Don\u2019t Pursue.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The button\u2019s options change according to the story. In moments where there\u2019s no clear way to avoid pursuit, or when the narrative requires it, only <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> will be shown.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918960?t=1765913071","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918960?t=1765913071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918960/02f3a840bbb6e71ff361b54b503b2794c4fd2513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765913071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918960/02f3a840bbb6e71ff361b54b503b2794c4fd2513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765913071","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This work contains depictions of romance between adult characters.\r\n\r\nThe protagonist falls in love with her step-uncle, and the story depicts the changes in their relationship.\r\n\r\nThe latter half of the story contains depictions with mild sexual overtones (such as a kissing scene).\r\nThis work does not contain depictions of sexual acts, extreme violence, sexual violence, self-harm, or drugs."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuing My Uncle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a week at your uncle\u2019s house in this short, choice-driven visual novel.<br>From time to time, a special <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button will appear, letting you move the story forward in unexpected ways.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approx. 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for ages 12 and up (R12)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button cannot be skipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the scene, the button may appear as <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Pursue / Don\u2019t Pursue.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The button\u2019s options change according to the story. In moments where there\u2019s no clear way to avoid pursuit, or when the narrative requires it, only <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> will be shown.</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u3075\u308f\u3075\u308f\u96fb\u5b50\u7814\u7a76\u6240"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918960/0040f1f9f786bbcfba772008017c20bb1e341b02/header.jpg?t=1765913071","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey / macOS 13 Ventura